Clients send a unique key per operation: Idempotency-Key: "8e03978e-40d5-43e8-bc93-6894a57f9324" (quotes optional).
A retry with the same key and body returns the stored response with Idempotent-Replayed: true. Keys are kept 24 hours (calm_idempotency, TTL index).
Make the header mandatory on some routes in calm.config.js: blocks: { idempotency: { required: ['POST /api/orders'] } }
